{"id": "r10_21", "text": "Drop all of the red pieces in the leftmost bin, the yellow ones in the rightmost bin and the blue ones in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_perm", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_22", "text": "Kindly deposit each red item in the center receptacle, each blue item in the left receptacle, and each yellow item in the right receptacle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_perm", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_23", "text": "All yellow things go left. All red things go left as well. Blue goes in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_24", "text": "First the blue objects into the right bin, then the yellow ones into the left bin, and finally the red ones into the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_perm", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_25", "text": "The middle bin is for red, and the right bin is for both yellow and blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_26", "text": "Please put anything that is blue into the left bin, and put the red and yellow items into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_shared", "adversarial": false}
