{"id": "r10_44", "text": "Put the red objects in the left bin and the yellow objects in the center bin. Don't touch the blue ones.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_45", "text": "Cylinders go to the middle bin. Leave the cubes and the triangles on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_46", "text": "Red to the right bin, blue to the left bin; yellow stays on the table.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_47", "text": "Move every yellow object into the left bin and every red object into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_uncovered", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_48", "text": "Sort everything by colour (red: middle, yellow: right, blue: left), but leave the triangles on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_49", "text": "Put the blue cubes and the red cylinders in the left bin. Nothing else needs to move.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_types", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_50", "text": "Pick up just the yellow pieces and drop them in the centre bin; the red and blue ones can stay put.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r10_51", "text": "Wait until the status light on the gripper turns blue, then sort: yellow objects to the left bin, everything else to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_colour_distractor", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_52", "text": "Unlike the red objects, which belong in the right bin, the blue objects belong in the left bin; the yellow objects belong in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_unlike", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_53", "text": "Red goes in the left bin, and so does blue. Yellow doesn't - it goes in the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_so_does", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_54", "text": "Hi, Fred here, with credit to the blueprint team for the setup: yellow objects go in the left bin, blue objects in the right bin, and red objects in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_substring", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_55", "text": "Every object that matches the colour of the yellow cylinder goes in the right bin, and every object that matches the colour of the red cube goes in the left bin. Blue objects go in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_shape_as_reference", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_56", "text": "Drop the blue objects in the left bin and the red ones in the right bin, gently, from no higher than a cube's height. Yellow goes to the center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_shape_as_unit", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_57", "text": "Red objects go in the bin that is neither the left one nor the right one, blue objects go in the left bin, and yellow objects go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_negated_bin", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r10_58", "text": "Rather than the middle bin, the blue objects go in the left bin, and rather than the left bin, the red objects go in the middle bin. Yellow objects go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_rather_than", "adversarial": true}
